4. Emoji / Fonts / GIF SDK
---------------------------
- Emoji codePoints in EmojiKeyboardView.java are raw Unicode scalar values
  (public domain code points). No Noto Color Emoji font file is bundled; if added later, Apache 2.0 / SIL OFL.
- Google Fonts (Phase 2) — each font SIL OFL / Apache 2.0 per font.
- GIF/sticker — Phase 3 provider: Giphy (https://giphy.com) via HTTPS API (api.giphy.com). No SDK bundled; plain HTTPS search using api.giphy.com. Giphy content under Giphy Terms of Service (https://giphy.com/legal) — user content. Attribution "Powered by Giphy" displayed in GifPanel. API key via BuildConfig.giphyApiKey (not hard-coded). No GIF fetch unless user opts in (default OFF).
- Sticker — Phase 3 local set (12 built-in emojis) + online stickers share GIF opt-in (same Giphy provider).
- One-handed mode — no third-party asset; pure layout.

